            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="0007" n="[Errata]" xml:id="pg-seq-0007"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p rendition="#center">Foreign Relations of the United States, 1948, Volume V, Part
                    2</p>
                <p rendition="#center">ERRATA</p>
                <p>On <ref target="#pg935">page 935</ref>, Clifford memorandum, second paragraph,
                    replace line one with the following: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Considerable doubt as to the advantage of the British “Neutral</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <p>On <ref target="#pg982">page 982</ref>, telegram 327, first paragraph, first
                    sentence, replace the word “Spanish” with:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">Special</p>
            </div>
        </body>
